  "body": "In need of some TLC but with great bones, this three-bedroom house is ready for enthusiastic or astute new owners to come and give it a little spruce up.  In an elevated position in a handy location, it has endless potential.  The value of the area is clear & if you need inspiration or motivation a recent 'Moving Houses' episode featured a house relocation & renovation just down the road.\r\n\r\nSituated in an elevated position with a view across Whangaparaoa Peninsula towards Stanmore Bay, this once charming three-bedroom home is a genuine opportunity for those with vision, imagination and a little creative flair.  \r\nWith its distinctive character, covered veranda and fully fenced back garden, there’s plenty here to work with.\r\n\r\nConvenience is another key attraction. Stanmore Bay beach, Leisure Centre & Whangaparaoa shops are within walking distance, putting everyday essentials, shopping and local amenities close at hand, & the busses stop just at the end of the road.\r\nAnd with the new Penlink motorway on-ramp just minutes away by car, getting around the peninsula and beyond is set to be even more convenient.\r\n\r\nSo, whether you’re considering a thoughtful redecoration, a comprehensive renovation or a complete remodel with the potential to extend, this property offers an exciting blank canvas in a sought-after peninsula setting.\r\n\r\nThe house may need some love, but the position has plenty to offer, so bring your vision. Unlock the potential. Make the most of the view.  This little peninsula property is ready for someone to give it a whole new lease on life. So, if you can see an opportunity & are prepared to get stuck in then come along see what you could turn this little cutie into.",
